{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/elF53a0RbF8r9zbLmRHyuw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:32.623793+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/elF53a0RbF8r9zbLmRHyuw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/3qY8aC0Y7AMKRzbVoZlibaoEicQJyHSXCbjFPoGUK1svHsXugTJaT2WsDSsBe7ew3pVbBibY7ibyiaIw26oIDHicqYRsk4icibuc57mItfVMQtvwYA0/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>北京科技大学新金属材料全国重点实验室</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2027年推免试硕士研究生（含直博生）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>预报名的通知</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、新金属材料全国重点实验室介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>      新金属材料全国重点实验室1989年经原国家计委和教育部批复，原冶金工业部批准于1991年依托北京科技大学筹建，1995年通过国家验收正式运行，通过五轮科技部组织的国家重点实验室评估，2025年通过科技部和教育部组织的国家重点实验室重组验收，更名为新金属材料全国重点实验室。</span></p><p><span>     实验室紧密围绕国家重大战略需求对金属材料提出的极端环境、极限性能、极低碳排放“三个极限”的重大挑战，在材料设计的基本原理、方法和关键技术等领域实现原始创新，实现金属材料高强高韧、高敏超精等性能极限化，保障新金属材料在极端温度、极端压力等恶劣服役环境下的可靠服役；同时突破金属材料绿色低碳制造、全生命周期服役安全评价与寿命预报等关键核心技术，着力解决制约国家发展和安全的“卡脖子”金属材料难题，发展中国标签前沿金属材料，为国家重大战略及科技强国建设提供更加强有力的支撑。</span></p><p><span>     实验室注重对外开放、合作与交流，积极邀请国内外知名专家学者来室讲学和交流工作，主办承办国际学术会议或参加国际学术会议，同时，选派教师和研究生到知名学术机构合作研究及承担国际科研项目，加强与国际材料科学领域的高层次联系和互动。在加强学术交流的同时，实验室十分注重与国内外企业的合作，建立产学研基地，促进科研成果的产业化和攻关企业运行中的技术性难题。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><b><span>二、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>     1、面向对象：全国高校材料类或相关专业2027年应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>     2、拥护中国共产党的领导，拥护社会主义制度，道德品质良好，遵纪守法，身体健康，学习成绩优异；</span></p><p><span>     3、有望获得2027年推荐免试资格，硕士推免生入学前应取得国家承认的本科学历证书，直博生入学前应取得国家承认的本科学历证书和学士学位证书，否则录取资格无效；</span></p><p><span>     4、英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>     5、本科阶段在一级学术刊物发表论文、获科研成果奖励、在全国重大竞赛中获奖者，优先接收；</span></p><p><span>     6、申请本科直博者，除满足上述条件外，还应具有较强的科研创新能力和博士生培养潜力。</span></p><p><span>     如提供虚假信息或材料，一经发现，立即取消资格及一切由此获得的利益，并保留追溯的权利。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、接收推免生的类型与专业 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/3qY8aC0Y7APvHFfaUsibtRT43zzwGqbD36nkJZ1OvibPzEjyAvvJIyKFkGkANNDhAIhoAq1icCTeiaiabg8ISPrAsDrfsPWc0GLK4dxI8n9oLV0Y/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>注：根据学校政策，学硕与专硕均可申请硕博连读。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、申请流程 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>     1、报名时间：即日起至</span><strong><span><span>9月6日24：00</span></span></strong></p><p><span>     2、报名方式：凡有意向申请者，包括本校生源在内，均须通过我校研究生招生管理信息系统申请报名。申请者可点击以下链接进入报名系统：http://yjsy.ustb.edu.cn/ksxt，招生项目选择“2027年推免生预报名”（建议使用谷歌浏览器）。</span></p><p><span>     请考生事先了解新金属材料全国重点实验室导师情况（见下列网址），然后上网申报并具体选择导师姓名。</span></p><p><span>   新金属材料全国重点实验室介绍：https://skl.ustb.edu.cn/sysgk/sysjs/index.htm</span></p><p><span>     导师介绍：https://skl.ustb.edu.cn/yjspy/dsjs/index.htm</span></p><p><span>     3、<span>材料提交</span>：</span></p><p><span>  （1）身份证（正反面）及学生证；</span></p><p><span>  （2）所在学校教务部门或学院盖章的前3年成绩单和成绩排名证明材料；</span></p><p><span>  （3）体现英语水平的证明材料(大学英语四、六级成绩，TOEFL成绩，GRE/GMAT成绩等)；</span></p><p><span>  （4）其他证明材料，如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等；</span></p><p><span>  （5）对申请有参考价值的个人陈述（限1000字以内）；</span></p><p><span>  （6）申请本科直博者还须提供《北京科技大学招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书》2份（须2名教授或相当职称的专家进行推荐，推荐人本人签名须手写）。此项材料在系统报名时可暂不上传，待取得推免资格并正式录取后提交。</span></p><p><span>   《专家推荐书模板》下载网址：</span></p><p><span>https://yzxc.ustb.edu.cn/cyxz/263329c27a1845eea6e8ca785153521f.htm</span></p><p><span>     申请人按照系统提示填写个人信息并上传相关证明材料的照片或PDF。材料提交截止日期为2025年9月6日，逾期不再接受申请。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、材料审核 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>      新金属材料全国重点实验室将在9月6日报名截止后，设立申请材料审核专家组，负责对考生申报材料开展评议审核，确定考生综合考核(复试)入围资格，申请人可登陆我校研究生招生管理信息系统查询审核结果。如材料不符合要求将退回修改，请在规定的时间内重新上传（登录系统查看），逾期视为自愿放弃。请各位申请者密切关注相关通知，审核通过即获得预复试资格，申请者应在规定时间内及时在系统内缴纳100元复试费并确认参加复试，未在规定时间内缴费并确认参加复试的，视为自愿放弃。缴纳预推免复试费后，如因个人原因未按时参加预复试的，已缴复试费不予退还。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、复试安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>      本次预推免考核采用线下方式进行，拟于9月开展复试，具体时间安排另行通知。请各位申请者关注新金属材料全国重点实验室官网或短信通知。</span></p><p><span>      1、综合素质测试：<span>3min</span>PPT陈述、面试专家提问。</span></p><p><span>   PPT内容要求：</span></p><p><span>    （1）专业素质和能力（<span>2min</span>）,包含：</span></p><p><span>本科学习成绩、基础和专业知识掌握情况、科研经历及相关实验技能；</span></p><p><span>个人的研究兴趣、对拟研究领域的了解、看法和研究设想；</span></p><p><span>    （2）综合素质和能力（<span>1min</span>），包含：</span></p><p><span>思想政治素质和道德品质；</span></p><p><span>本学科以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的情况；</span></p><p><span>      2、外语水平测试：英文（<span>1min</span>），包含：自我介绍、阅读翻译，回答面试专家的提问等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、其他注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>      1、通过新金属材料全国重点实验室预推免面试考核的考生，务必按照教育部要求在规定时间内（9月下旬）登录中国研招网“推免服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）填报志愿，网上完成接收并确认新金属材料全国重点实验室的复试及待录取通知等环节，未通过中国研招网“推免服务系统”报名和接受待录取的考生，预复试考核结果一律无效。</span></p><p><span>      2、若通过推免预复试考核的学生获得推免资格且第一志愿申请北京科技大学新金属材料全国重点实验室的，新金属材料全国重点实验室不再安排推荐免试选拔复试，将根据预推免复试成绩优先录取，额满为止。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>地点：北京市海淀区学院路30号北京科技大学</span></p><p><span>新金属材料全国重点实验室（主楼260）</span></p><p><span>联系人：孙老师010-62333046</span></p><p><span>邮 箱：sunqiaobing@ustb.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>新金属材料全国重点实验室网址：</span></p><p><span>https://skl.ustb.edu.cn/sysgk/sysjs/index.htm</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>八、监督投诉</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>新金属材料全国重点实验室党委</span></p><p><span>电话：010-62333703</span></p><p><span>邮箱：wangjia@ustb.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/3qY8aC0Y7APxgg3tHKnhUNcVpNxgZiaiaUvWkHV4cB9Pl4MNNWa9vsImxHYl6sCXKETXwhza6GdQcLXZVicLKgsDCpNa5dF8Pj4NVGYGecdZ0k/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p><span>出品：新金属材料全国重点实验室学工办</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 王军琪</span></p><p><span>审核 | 赵高闻璐</span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c2df900fe3d49b250cdad23fe087c74b98f0438079504ed32e9ae4d96ef8fa20","textLength":2733,"sourceSha256":"8529f2f195c94cf2482600a589754fb88ec2183e4535382bce91cb73d99d3a2e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f09de50d4d5e96239177","title":"2026年北京科技大学新金属材料全国重点实验室2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:32.623793+00:00"}
